      7. How Petsfolio Platform Works
      The Platform can be used to book Pet Services provided by Service Providers. These Pet Services are shown on the Listings on the Platform. Service Users may be required to provide personal information, including without limitation about their house address, phone number, email ID and the details of their Pet such as name, age, breed etc. Each Service Provider can set the details and prices for the Pet Services only in accordance with the parameters allowed by the Platform. It is not possible to view Listings as an unregistered visitor to the Platform. If You want to book Pet Services provided by the Platform or set up a Listing for Yourself, You need to create an Account.

      Each Service Provider must provide the Pet Services in accordance with the relevant Booking, and each Service User must pay the Booking Fee and the Pet Service Fee pursuant to that Booking via the Payment Gateway.

      Petsfolio connects Service Users and Service Providers and provides the Payment Gateway as set out in these Terms. However, Petsfolio plays no role in the agreements between Service Users and Service Providers with regards to the provision of Pet Services. Service Providers and Service Users are solely responsible for such agreements.

      The Service User is obliged to pay the Pet Service Fee and/or Booking Fee applicable to a Booking using the Payment Gateway at the time both the Service User and the Service Provider have agreed on the Booking made through the Platform. The Pet Service Fee paid by the relevant Service User will be retained by Petsfolio until the completion date (or an extended period if there is a dispute, fraud/unauthorized transaction) of the relevant Booking in accordance with these Terms. Subject to the Withholding Period, Petsfolio will transfer the relevant Pet Service Fee, less Our Service Commission, to the Service Provider’s nominated bank account, after the Service Provider has submitted a withdrawal request for the payment.

      Each Service Provider acknowledges that, notwithstanding that the relevant Withholding Period for a Booking may have ended, a Service User may be legally entitled to a refund or other remedy with respect to the Pet Services under any applicable law. To the maximum extent allowed at law, each Service Provider indemnifies Petsfolio with respect to any and all costs or expenses incurred by Petsfolio with respect to such a claim made by a Service User with respect to Pet Services performed by that Service Provider, whether before or after the Withholding Period applicable to the relevant Booking.

