      Each Service User agrees that any costs or expenses incurred in connection with obtaining veterinary care or other medical assistance with respect to the Service User’s Pet under a Booking may be charged directly to the Service User. The Service User also authorizes the Payment Gateway Provider to charge any amount that we consider to be the subject of such indemnity. These amounts may be charged from the nominated bank account of the Service User using any credit card or PayPal details provided by the Service User.

